# Governance data
#
# Nothing the platform writes reaches the working tree: the database is a Docker
# named volume (grc-data) and the API writes no files. These patterns cover what
# a person puts here by hand. A database dump, a risk register or a control
# export carries the organisation's real risks, controls, exceptions and audit
# trail, which is the one category of content this repository must never hold.
*.sql
*.dump
*.db
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
*.csv
*.tsv
*.xls
*.xlsx
